# Assembled at build time by @fmmenchi/nx-docusaurus (sync-docs) — not committed.
# Each package folder is a copy of that package’s docs/; the _category_.json markers stay.
client/*/
ops/*/
plugins/*/
server/*/
shared/*/
# `tools` was missing from this list, and the gap was not theoretical: a stale
# `tools/figma-tokens/` — output of a package dropped in "chore: drop the figma
# bridge" — sat untracked in a worktree until a `git add -A` swept it into an
# unrelated commit. The six scopes here are `packages/*`; leaving one out means
# that scope's generated docs are committable by accident.
tools/*/
